# API boundaries

- Validate and normalize input at the boundary; keep domain logic free of transport details.
- Return stable error shapes; do not leak stack traces, secrets, or internal identifiers.
- Document auth requirements, idempotency, and backward compatibility for every public endpoint change.
- Add or update tests for success paths and representative failure paths.
